WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.087
Each request body is built only
from shapes Learn documents.

2
00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:06.288
A role series reviews users.

3
00:00:06.288 --> 00:00:09.413
The groups that hold the role
aren't reviewed inside it;

4
00:00:09.413 --> 00:00:13.580
each gets its own membership series,
which matches the workbook's design

5
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:17.400
of pairing every role review with
a review of its privileged group.

6
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.425
Group reviews cover the group's
members, a feature still in preview.

7
00:00:21.425 --> 00:00:25.277
Azure role reviews go to Resource
Manager on a preview version,

8
00:00:25.277 --> 00:00:29.500
and their reviewers must be people
or service principals, not groups.

9
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.249
One honest gap: Learn's
request table doesn't list some

10
00:00:33.249 --> 00:00:36.980
fields the code sets, so Lab
2 checks they take effect.
